// EVOROW - row-reduction engine on [I]/[J] (M x N).   F=1 REF, F=2 RREF.
// Pivots are only sought in columns 1..E.  L=1 logs every operation (start
// matrix saved to slot 4) so EVOSTEP can replay them.
// Out: U = rank, ʟMXPR(col) = pivot row (0 = free column), θ = (-1)^(row swaps)
// Exact mode: first nonzero entry is the pivot.  Approximate mode: largest |entry|.
// Clobbers: A B C D I J K O P Q R S X Y Z G H
If L:Then
{0}→ʟMXLOG
4→Z:prgmEVOSAVE
End
N→dim(ʟMXPR)
Fill(0,ʟMXPR)
0→U:1→θ
For(C,1,E)
If U<M:Then
0→K:0→X
For(I,U+1,M)
If [I](I,C)≠0:Then
If V:Then
If abs([I](I,C)/[J](I,C))>X:Then
I→K:abs([I](I,C)/[J](I,C))→X
End
Else
If not(K):I→K
End
End
End
If K:Then
U+1→U
If K≠U:Then
1→A:U→B:K→D:0→X:1→Y:prgmEVOROWOP
⁻θ→θ
End
U→ʟMXPR(C)
If F=2 and ([I](U,C)≠1 or [J](U,C)≠1):Then
[J](U,C)→X:[I](U,C)→Y
If Y<0:Then
⁻X→X:⁻Y→Y
End
If V:Then
X/Y→X:1→Y
End
2→A:U→B:prgmEVOROWOP
1→[I](U,C):1→[J](U,C)
End
For(I,1,M)
If I≠U and (F=2 or I>U):Then
If [I](I,C)≠0:Then
[I](I,C)→P:[J](I,C)→Q:[I](U,C)→R:[J](U,C)→S:4→O:prgmEVOFRAC
⁻P→X:Q→Y
3→A:I→B:U→D:prgmEVOROWOP
0→[I](I,C):1→[J](I,C)
End
End
End
End
End
End
